    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey prof, i'm stuck on this signal processing homework. i get the formula for the fourier transform but i dont really get the actual intuition behind it. like what am i actually doing to the signal when i transform it? can u explain it in a way that makes sense physically?",
