    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so it's like an overlap or an integral? i'm trying to visualize the \"weighting\" part. if i have a messy signal with a bunch of random noise, how does the math know to ignore the noise and only pick up the actual frequencies? it feels like there's some kind of sorting happening behind the scenes.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
